Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Pack the room into five useful groups

Co-Authored-By: GPT-6.1 Sol <noreply@openai.com>
---
 assets/3d/pack.mjs                            |  32 ++++++++++++++----
 src/lib/boot/assets/room-bonsai.glb           | Bin 0 -> 238096 bytes
 src/lib/boot/assets/room-clock.glb            | Bin 0 -> 68580 bytes
 src/lib/boot/assets/room-cube.glb             | Bin 0 -> 44620 bytes
 .../assets/{bedroom.glb => room-shell.glb}    | Bin 1183392 -> 678620 bytes
 src/lib/boot/assets/room-sp.glb               | Bin 0 -> 155316 bytes
 6 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/lib/boot/assets/room-bonsai.glb
 create mode 100644 src/lib/boot/assets/room-clock.glb
 create mode 100644 src/lib/boot/assets/room-cube.glb
